// The debug world set's player: the standard player module (../standard/player/player.puck) wearing the Moth
// (avatars/moth/), born in her mech suit. Every world of the set seats its players through this document, most of them
// by building on the stage (stage.puck), which imports it. It authors nothing of its own: the kits, the suit switch, the
// chase camera and the play layout are the module's, read from her contract; her looks and rig are her avatar
// document's. The set's keys for the suit switch are suit.puck's.
schema: "puck.world.definition.v1"
import "../standard/inputs"
import "../standard/player/player"
import "../standard/player/actions"
import "avatars/moth/contract"
import "avatars/moth/moth"

player(avatar: mothAvatar, rig: "moth-camera")

// The climb's stamina wheel, low on the view while it is not full.
staminaGauge()
